Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.05,0:02:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we' ve come a long way, Walt.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.88,0:02:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Here at the end of round one...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.63,0:02:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,...l'm gonna recommend\Ncautious optimism.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.55,0:02:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We' ll check back in two months,\Nsee how you' ve responded...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.43,0:02:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,...reassess and decide our next move,\Nif any.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.48,0:02:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right around the time\Nthe baby's due, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.98,0:02:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.48,0:02:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, try to think of this\Nas good timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.61,0:02:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You' ll start feeling better soon,\Nmore like yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.36,0:02:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And your hair should start\Nto come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.87,0:03:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Kind of gotten used\Nto the old cue-ball look.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.16,0:03:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,-l prefer to think of it as streamlined.\N-Right. Aerodynamic.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.71,0:03:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,So no more confusion?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.30,0:03:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,-No more--?\N-No. No. Absolutely none.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.97,0:03:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you two holding up?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.72,0:03:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.93,0:03:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, you know, we're busy...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.27,0:03:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,...but we're good. Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.48,0:03:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.03,0:03:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,So we're not going through an insurer.\NIs that correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.11,0:03:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. Direct bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.20,0:03:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Just need to print it out for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.06,0:04:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.32,0:04:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought we had discussed\Na cash discount.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.08,0:04:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Absolutely. lt's included.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.95,0:04:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a reminder.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.92,0:04:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We do have a payment plan available,\Nshould you be interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.88,0:04:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.38,0:04:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.38,0:04:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.26,0:04:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.90,0:04:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, well,\Nthen what about the MRI?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.90,0:05:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you--?\NCan you please explain to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.16,0:05:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,...the distinction between\Ndiagnostic and exploratory?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.62,0:05:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but either way,\Nhis doctor ordered it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.54,0:05:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, you know,\Nit should be covered.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.34,0:05:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You bet l will. Yeah, in triplicate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.80,0:05:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Well, I'm sorry\Nyou couldn' t be of more help too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.47,0:05:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.81,0:05:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.77,0:05:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.06,0:05:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Been around someone\Nwho smokes?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.98,0:05:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.44,0:05:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The hospital bill came.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.65,0:05:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,-That was fast.\N-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.82,0:05:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Three-day stay,\N1 3,000 and counting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.17,0:05:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this something that\NGretchen and Elliott might cover?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.42,0:05:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.01,0:06:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,...l know it's strictly your domain,\Nbut....
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.34,0:06:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,They will. I'm sure they will.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.64,0:06:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.96,0:08:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.17,0:08:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring me up to speed on\NTuco Salamanca.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.38,0:08:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-Dead.\N-Still?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.64,0:08:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,-Completely.\N-Okay, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.06,0:08:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,-Well, thanks for stopping by.\N-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.52,0:09:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,So things are quiet, you know.\NNot a lot of crystal on the streets now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.98,0:09:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,-Good.\N-Of course, that's not gonna last.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.52,0:09:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait to see who rallies the roaches\Nnow that turf's up for grabs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.69,0:09:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,No takers so far?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.32,0:09:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we keep hearing a name.\NHeisenberg.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.87,0:09:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Lately pretty much every dime-bagger\Nwe come across.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.49,0:09:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,-Heisenberg?\N-Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.00,0:09:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's a tweaker urban legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.87,0:09:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, somebody somewhere is cooking\Nthat big blue we keep finding.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.21,0:09:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, we'll stay on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.55,0:09:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Know why sharks are at the top\Nof the food chain, Hank?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.05,0:09:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Because they have three sets of teeth\Nand will take a bite out of anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.06,0:09:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Some of those suckers\Ntravel thousands of miles...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.77,0:09:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,...in pursuit of their prey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.06,0:09:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, l think l heard that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.57,0:09:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You, my friend, are a great white.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.49,0:09:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,How does Albuquerque liaison...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.53,0:09:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,...Tri-State Border Interdiction\NTask Force sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.83,0:09:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Like one hell of a promotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.41,0:10:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,As of the 1 st, l want you to split\Nyour time between here and El Paso.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.29,0:10:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, sir. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.25,0:10:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What you gonna do without me,\NGomey?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.17,0:10:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Celebrate. I won' t have to look\Nat your ugly mug six days a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.97,0:10:14.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, buddy,\NI am the brains and the brawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.97,0:10:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,-l'm the whole package.\N-l'm glad I didn't just eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.60,0:10:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised your head still fits\Nthrough the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.27,0:10:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,-You wanna grab lunch?\N-Hell, yeah. Because you're buying.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.14,0:10:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Done.\NI'll meet you morons downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.11,0:10:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Try not to get lost on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.27,0:10:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Schrader.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.48,0:10:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Hey, Ricky.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.82,0:10:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,How you doing?\NYeah, l'm stoked too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.66,0:10:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, El Paso.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.62,0:10:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's the man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.58,0:10:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hey, congratulations, Hank.\N-Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.94,0:11:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Gets two in the sand,\Ntwo in the forest, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.36,0:11:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And then he says,\N"Give me a four," you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.78,0:11:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.77,0:12:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,-Hey.\N-Got some nerve coming back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.44,0:12:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Or you' re even dumber\Nthan l thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.57,0:12:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, maybe both.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.87,0:12:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Balance for the tow, the repairs...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.08,0:12:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,...and extra for damages and stuff,\Nthe gate...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.08,0:12:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,...the toilet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.38,0:12:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, like I said...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.63,0:13:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,...my word is my bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.02,0:13:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What would you charge me\Nto store this here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.24,0:13:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-A million-five.\N-Come on, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.36,0:13:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,-Your sister.\N-Dog, l'm serious, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.78,0:13:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I got storage needs.\NAnd l got scratch up front.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.62,0:13:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We could, you know, negotiate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.34,0:13:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Five hundred.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.76,0:13:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,-A month?\N-A week.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.55,0:13:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.22,0:13:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,-See you.\N-Wait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.06,0:13:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Just hold on. Just chill.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.10,0:13:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Sounds good. Totally doable.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.19,0:13:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-Outside.\N-lnside.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.48,0:13:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,-Forget it.\N-Man, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.57,0:14:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Your fence is too easy to climb.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.57,0:14:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Inside, padlocked,\Nplus gate privileges.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.32,0:14:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-Come again?\N-Gate, in and out, privileges.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.49,0:14:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Month to month. Cash up front.\NInside.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.41,0:14:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And l don't know you.\NI don't know jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.17,0:14:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.93,0:14:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You selling?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.31,0:14:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll let you take it for nine Gs.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.15,0:14:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What about that one?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.03,0:14:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.22,0:15:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Jane, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.14,0:15:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Jane, I gotta say,\Nthis place is awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.81,0:15:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,-Really? Does it inspire awe?\N-No. I mean, you know, it's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.03,0:15:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Just what l've been looking for.\NThat's what l meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.65,0:15:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I had an entire house before,\Ndetached and all...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.74,0:15:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,...but l was just tired of the lawn care,\Nupkeep and whatnot. You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.29,0:15:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, the blinds are new.\NEverything's been painted.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.17,0:15:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.46,0:15:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Utilities are included.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.05,0:15:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Stacking. Sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.05,0:15:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,-You got cable?\N-Already wired. Just call to activate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.97,0:15:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,High speed, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.80,0:15:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Bathroom, cool tile.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.85,0:15:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Bedroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.72,0:15:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.06,0:15:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a fan of the hardwood.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.44,0:16:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,-So you' re interested?\N-Definitely. Definitely, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.90,0:16:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're good with NP, NS?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.53,0:16:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.82,0:16:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,In the ad? No smoking, no pets.\NYou wanna smoke, you do it outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.20,0:16:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,No. Yeah, yeah, yeah, no.\NIt's cool. No worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.33,0:16:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, the usual drill. l'll need a W-2\Nor recent pay stub, current employer...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.63,0:16:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,...former address, you know,\Nthe yadda yadda.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.42,0:16:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,And if it's all copacetic, I' ll call.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.05,0:16:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Look...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.14,0:16:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,...the thing is...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.80,0:16:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,...l can....
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.64,0:16:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.31,0:16:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,-l'm just currently between situations.\N-Then l'm currently not renting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.14,0:16:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, look, I got the money and\NI'm totally good for it for, like, ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.98,0:16:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, yo, can you please,\Nplease just help a brother out?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.65,0:16:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, my dad's not really\Na make-exceptions kind of guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.45,0:16:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,-Trust me.\N-Your dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.82,0:16:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Owns the place. l manage it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.83,0:16:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Pen on paper. That's what I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.25,0:16:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Or go run your game\Nsomewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.16,0:17:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Dude, I got nowhere else to go.\NThis is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.58,0:17:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And l got no game, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.17,0:17:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I just need a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.01,0:17:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, my folks, they kicked me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.64,0:17:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a disappointment, apparently.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.81,0:17:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't meet their expectations again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.89,0:17:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,So you know, now\NI'm persona non gratis or whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.90,0:17:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,But you know what?\NI'm a good person and I work hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.23,0:17:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I will pay you every month\Nand l will pay you on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.86,0:17:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not mess this up, okay?\NI swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.87,0:17:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Rent just went up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.71,0:17:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,A hundred more a month.\NThat's the cash price.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.21,0:17:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.51,0:17:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.22,0:17:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you rock. Thank you.\NThank you. You won't regret this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.14,0:17:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And in addition to first and last,\NI want two more months.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.05,0:17:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,DBAA fee, nonrefundable.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.72,0:18:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, of course. No problem.\NDBAA. Obviously, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.23,0:18:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. So, what's DBAA?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.40,0:18:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,-Don't be an asshole.\N-Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.95,0:18:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,-l live next door.\N-Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.70,0:18:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't think for one second you have\Nsquatter's rights, because you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.24,0:18:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If you blow this, I want you gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.00,0:18:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I know guys that'll have your skinny\Nass out back by the Dumpster...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.29,0:18:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,...faster than you can blink.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.21,0:18:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll fill it in. Just sign your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.42,0:18:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Which is what, by the way?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.92,0:18:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Jesse.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.76,0:18:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Jesse Jackson.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.39,0:18:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.10,0:18:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.32,0:19:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,-What are you doing?\N-Beating off. What's it look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.11,0:19:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,That is in fact exactly\Nwhat it looks like to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.78,0:19:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Brewing is an art form, Marie.\NI think you'd appreciate that by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.08,0:19:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Christmas, batch of '06? Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.29,0:19:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So let me get this straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.67,0:19:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You call in sick the day after\Nreceiving a long-awaited...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.46,0:19:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,...career-boosting promotion...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.01,0:19:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,...so you can play Oktoberfest\Nin your man cave?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.18,0:20:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it. Really, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.10,0:20:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Babe, relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.93,0:20:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,-Please, don't tell me to relax.\N-Sorry, l forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.81,0:20:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,-You know l hate that.\N-Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.02,0:20:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Dave said l should express that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.98,0:20:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,All I'm saying is everything's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.69,0:20:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I can take a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.45,0:20:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.36,0:20:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Now get that sweet ass out of here\Nso l can concentrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.14,0:22:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, so, what' s the plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.15,0:22:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The plan is we cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.65,0:22:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are we cooking when we can't\Neven move what we cook?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.08,0:22:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, how much do you think\Nyou can sell on your own?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.87,0:22:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Say if l cook during the days\Nand you work the nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.79,0:22:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,-Dude.\N-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.34,0:22:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Prior to Tuco,\Nthat was your plan, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.84,0:22:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand it'll be a fraction\Nof what we brought in before...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.47,0:22:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,-...but still, what choice do we have?\N-First of all, there's no we.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.89,0:22:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay? You're talking me, solo,\Nbusting hump slinging shards.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.19,0:22:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I got profile now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.60,0:22:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you get that?\NDEA's up my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.02,0:23:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm not exposing myself\Nto that level of risk for chump change.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.61,0:23:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-No way.\N-Then what do you suggest?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.36,0:23:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think either of us are eager\Nto jump into bed with another Tuco.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.04,0:23:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I got bills, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.88,0:23:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You' ve got bills?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.38,0:23:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Rent, yo. Responsibilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.42,0:23:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I've already lost more than\NI've made...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.42,0:23:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,...and l am tired\Nof dicking around out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.30,0:23:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You wanna know how much\NI've got left?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.55,0:23:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,After completing\Nmy first round of treatment...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.85,0:23:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,...and financing\Nthe world' s most expensive alibi?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.56,0:23:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Zero. Zip. Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.73,0:23:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got nothing to show for all of this.\NNothing for my family...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.02,0:23:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,...which, as you might remember,\Nwas the whole damn point.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.20,0:23:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,But seeing as throwing in the towel\Nis not an option...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.16,0:23:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,...that leaves us with a total\Nof two choices:
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.41,0:23:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We go into business\Nwith yet another homicidal lunatic...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.67,0:23:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,...or you and l start--
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.92,0:24:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You selling whatever you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.76,0:24:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a third way.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.26,0:24:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And what would that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.93,0:24:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We got to be Tuco.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.19,0:24:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,All right? Cut out the middleman.\NRun our own game.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.77,0:24:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're going to what?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.82,0:24:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Snort meth off a bowie knife?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.19,0:24:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You gonna beat your homeys to death\Nwhen they "dis" you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.45,0:24:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, l know some guys.\NAll right? l can create a network.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.20,0:24:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, we control production\Nand distribution.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.29,0:24:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That way, we stay off the front lines\Nwhile moving some serious glass.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.71,0:24:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, the point here is\Nto make money, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.96,0:24:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Sky-high stacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.30,0:24:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,-No.\N-No? That's not the point?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.30,0:24:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I am not willing to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.81,0:24:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Who said anything about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.89,0:25:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't vote for this plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.10,0:25:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not comfortable bringing in\Nunknown entities into our operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.48,0:25:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah? Well, you don't get to vote.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.66,0:25:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I beg your pardon?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.99,0:25:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,-This is a partnership, remember?\N-l rem-- Oh, l remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.00,0:25:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you cook, I sell.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.33,0:25:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,That was the division of labor\Nwhen we started all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.83,0:25:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And that' s exactly\Nhow we should have kept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.21,0:25:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I sure as hell didn' t\Nfind myself locked in a trunk...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.26,0:25:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,...or on my knees\Nwith a gun to my head...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.68,0:25:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,...before your greedy old ass\Ncame along. All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.64,0:25:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, l will admit\Nto a bit of a learning curve.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.52,0:25:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And perhaps\NI was overly ambitious.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.94,0:25:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,In any case, it's not gonna happen\Nthat way anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.57,0:25:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, damn straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.45,0:25:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.66,0:25:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Because we do things\Nmy way this time...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.66,0:25:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,...or l walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.00,0:26:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You need me more than\NI need you, Walt.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.27,0:26:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, enter my casa.\NYo, Skinny Pete. What's up, brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.24,0:26:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What up with it, yo?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.45,0:26:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Combo. Good to see you.\NWelcome to my humble abode.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.91,0:26:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Good deal, mover. Good deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.66,0:26:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yo, Badge, hey.\N-Cool crib, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.08,0:26:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, it echoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.92,0:26:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.75,0:26:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello. Hello, hello, hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.92,0:26:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me give you the virtual tour,\Nokay?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.84,0:26:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,So plasma is gonna go right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.59,0:26:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Probably like 50-inch,\Nyou know, wall-mounted.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.85,0:26:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Plasma rocks it over LCD, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.26,0:27:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,No. They burn in, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.14,0:27:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,But the picture's, like, way sharper.\NBlacks are deeper too.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.48,0:27:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,They got 3-D coming out,\Nlike, any day now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.27,0:27:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what l'm waiting for.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.15,0:27:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,-Porn, coz. You know?\N-Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.57,0:27:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Like 3-D tatas,\Nlike right in your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.28,0:27:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. So I' m gonna get a couple\Nof those zero-gravity chairs...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.37,0:27:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,...for, like, right here,\Nfor your ultimate viewing comfort.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.41,0:27:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are buck.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.75,0:27:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be pretty much sparse.\NVery Asiany, modern stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.96,0:27:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,-Feng shui, yo. I can dig it.\N-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.29,0:27:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking, you know,\Njust a bunch of candles...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.71,0:27:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,...maybe one of those\Nlittle fountain jobs right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.34,0:27:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,-lt's gonna be chill.\N-The ladies...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.34,0:27:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,...they cream up real nice for,\Nlike, candles and shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.01,0:27:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You are going to score, big time.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.77,0:27:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, so how about we get,\Nyou know, down to it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.31,0:27:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,There's some refreshments over here\Nif you wanna partake.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.65,0:27:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You got any other refreshments?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.49,0:27:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,-l could kick it. lt' s been a while.\N-Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.57,0:27:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I could totally go\Nfor a loving spoonful.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.20,0:28:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no.\NNo bomb, no beer, no weed. All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.66,0:28:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You smoke it up on your own time.\NWe' re talking business here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.04,0:28:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay? So listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.33,0:28:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This is how it goes.\NI front each of you an ounce.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.21,0:28:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You sell it for 2,500.\NI keep the two, you keep the five.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.34,0:28:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,No cutting it.\NYou sell it as is, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.30,0:28:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Twenty-five hundred an ounce?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.97,0:28:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That's kind of hopeful, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.68,0:28:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yeah, Jesse, street's maybe 1 7, 1 8.\N-Seventeen.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.35,0:28:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, A, this is the best shiz ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.27,0:28:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,All right? Everybody and their mother's\Ngonna want a taste. And second...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.90,0:28:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,...who else is selling right now,\Nhuh?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.20,0:28:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,-lt's dry out there, that' s for sure.\N-Church.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.45,0:28:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,So you point it how you want, okay?\NQuarter, half, teener, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.91,0:28:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But l make what l make.\NTwo large. No exceptions.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.29,0:28:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Short me, you' re out.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.71,0:28:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut it, you're out.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.50,0:28:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Period.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.34,0:28:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a big opportunity\NI am giving you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.47,0:28:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.22,0:29:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Badger, what is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.06,0:29:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,A big opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.85,0:29:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly. All right?\NThis is the ground floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.52,0:29:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen,\Nhow far you go is up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.23,0:29:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,So bring out the product, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.90,0:29:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no. Not here, all right?\NNot ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.86,0:29:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Blind drop. I will let you know\Nwhen and where.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.20,0:29:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,All right?\NSo you'll be hearing from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.87,0:29:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, l got mad volume.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.87,0:29:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So you move it quick,\Nyou move it right...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.75,0:29:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,...there is always more.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.26,0:29:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, DBAA, mofos. All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.80,0:29:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Apply yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.22,0:29:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.76,0:30:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, there's the big guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.17,0:30:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-Congratulations, Uncle Hank.\N-Hey, Hank.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.64,0:30:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an armpit.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.01,0:30:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not an armpit.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.97,0:30:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.81,0:30:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You' re right.\NIt's the Paris of the Southwest.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.56,0:30:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, it's Texas, for God's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.15,0:30:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Right on the border\Nof lawless Mexican hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.73,0:30:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Human heads, they leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.03,0:30:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The cartels, they litter the place\Nwith human heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.32,0:30:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, pretty sure\Nthat's why I'm going there.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.62,0:30:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like a calling card\Nor a shoutout or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.75,0:30:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, D.C., on the other hand,\NI could get behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.83,0:30:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You just do your time\Nlike a good boy...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.67,0:31:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,...and l could see us\Nin a cute little condo in Georgetown...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.84,0:31:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,...in a couple of years.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.61,0:31:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I went online to this fantastic...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.07,0:31:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,...real estate website for D.C.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.20,0:31:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,There's just so much,\NI don't know, culture there.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.20,0:31:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I was talking to Melinda,\NHank's boss' s wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.45,0:31:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you about the one with\Nhelmet hair and permanent lip liner.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.71,0:31:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, she was saying that\Nwhen they were there--
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.72,0:31:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.51,0:31:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.26,0:31:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not listen to one more word\Nuntil you apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.77,0:32:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-For?\N-You know perfectly well, Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.73,0:32:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,-Well, obviously l don't--\N-Your lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.95,0:32:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,To me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.03,0:32:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The shoplifting.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.28,0:32:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,All of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.08,0:32:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you really think it was all just\Nneatly gonna go away?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.75,0:32:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if you hadn't tried to return it--
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.29,0:32:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.34,0:32:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Now or never. l mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.59,0:32:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Or it' ll never be the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.35,0:32:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you punishing me?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.85,0:32:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't respect me enough to\Napologize, to tell me the truth, then--
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.12,0:32:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I need my sister back.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.97,0:33:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.61,0:33:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-What do you want, the gory details?\N-Yeah. Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.49,0:33:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.49,0:33:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep you up at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.33,0:33:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,So was it scary?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.46,0:33:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell, yeah, it was freaking scary,\Nyou little punk.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.21,0:33:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.46,0:33:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But you were way faster than him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.21,0:33:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, l'm here, aren't l?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.76,0:33:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Hell, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.05,0:33:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Kick ass and take names.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.60,0:33:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,-Son.\N-No, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.47,0:34:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.64,0:34:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,A cockroach comes out\Nfrom under a fridge, what do you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.52,0:34:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, you don't think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.07,0:34:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You stomp them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.07,0:34:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Where do they come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.99,0:34:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Criminals, like the one you....
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.78,0:34:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, what do you think it is\Nthat makes them who they are?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.37,0:34:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Buddy, you might as well be\Nasking me about the roaches.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.30,0:34:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,All I know is there's a whole world\Nof them out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.34,0:34:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, l gotta piss like a racehorse.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.10,0:36:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Cops.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.60,0:36:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Cops!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.25,0:37:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Wasn't sure it was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.38,0:37:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,New car?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.92,0:37:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, keeping things on the DL.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.92,0:38:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm guessing\Nthis one doesn' t bounce.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.27,0:38:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Your half.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.39,0:38:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Fifteen K.\NThat's what l'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.57,0:38:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You' re welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.32,0:38:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.91,0:38:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me understand the math,\Nokay?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.24,0:38:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I gave you 1 pound, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.33,0:38:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You and I split $2,000 per ounce.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.45,0:38:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,$1 ,000 each.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.46,0:38:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,One pound, that's 1 6 ounces.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.58,0:38:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sixteen ounces should net\Nto me $1 6,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.63,0:38:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Sixteen. Not 1 5.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.14,0:38:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Something came up.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.10,0:38:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Something came up?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.64,0:38:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,One of my guys got held up\Nby a couple junkies.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.93,0:38:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Lost an ounce. But it's cool, okay?\NSkinny Pete's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.32,0:39:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're saying\Nthat your guy got robbed--
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.49,0:39:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Or rather you got robbed.\N--but it doesn' t matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.74,0:39:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Dude, it's called breakage, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.74,0:39:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Like Kmart. Shit breaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.66,0:39:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're thinking\Nthis is acceptable?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.83,0:39:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the cost of business, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.13,0:39:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You' re sweating me over a grand?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.80,0:39:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look, l'm just the chemist here.\NI'm not the street guy, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.43,0:39:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But it seems to me\Nthat what you call breakage...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.89,0:39:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,...is just you making a fool\Nof yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.81,0:39:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got another technical\Nterm for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.81,0:39:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Non-sustainable business model.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.19,0:39:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You' re focusing on the negative.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.65,0:39:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Six grand a day we're making.\NWhat's your problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.19,0:39:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What happens when\Nword gets out...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.49,0:39:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,...and it's open season\Non these clowns you've hired?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.12,0:39:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Once everyone knows that\NJesse Pinkman...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.24,0:39:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,...drug lord,\Ncan be robbed with impunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.54,0:39:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.04,0:40:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You think Tuco had breakage?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.51,0:40:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess it' s true, he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.55,0:40:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He broke bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.59,0:40:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He broke the skull of anybody\Nwho tried to rip him off.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.05,0:40:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You want another grand?\NIs that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.77,0:40:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,-That's not my point.\N-Take it. Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.85,0:40:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, you got 1 5,000\Nyou didn't have yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.98,0:40:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, we're making bank.\NShit happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.36,0:40:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,My guys get what they're up against\Nand they're careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.20,0:40:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So am l.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.74,0:40:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're all tucked in at night\Nwith your precious family.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.66,0:40:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So why don't you just stop being\Nsuch a freak about everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.75,0:40:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You' ve made\Nthe division of labor very clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.08,0:40:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, l mean, seriously...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.71,0:40:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,...what the hell\Ndo you want me to do, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.45,0:41:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.66,0:41:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.12,0:41:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, you snuck in.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.08,0:41:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't even know you were home.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.29,0:41:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What you eating?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.71,0:41:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,A panini. There's another one\Nin the freezer if you want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.96,0:41:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought we nixed those, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.88,0:41:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Did we?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.68,0:41:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. l mean, aren' t those the ones\Nwith the off-the-chart sodium?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.14,0:41:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I had a craving.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.18,0:41:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Once in a while is no big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.48,0:41:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,So where's Jr.?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.99,0:41:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Out.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.66,0:41:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,With whom?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.99,0:41:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Louis.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.41,0:42:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Out where?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.04,0:42:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Somewhere. I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.17,0:42:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,-He' ll be back by 9.\N-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.84,0:42:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, l just thought you might\Nhave a clue where your son is.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.72,0:42:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don' t you?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.68,0:42:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Why am l the only one who needs\Nto keep track of our son?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.02,0:42:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you what.\NWanna know where he is, ask him.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.65,0:42:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Just pick up the phone like I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.50,0:42:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.79,0:42:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you might know\Nsomething...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.21,0:42:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,...about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.22,0:42:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.22,0:42:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And then again...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.39,0:43:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,...perhaps I don't, Walt.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.81,0:43:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps I smoked them\Nin a fugue state.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.40,0:43:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like an explanation, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.57,0:43:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,-You don' t wanna go down that road.\N-Why would you do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.65,0:43:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,-You're pregnant, for God's sakes.\N-Three and a half cigarettes...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.91,0:43:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,...won' t do a thing to the baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.57,0:43:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,-Nothing.\N-l'm glad you're so sure, doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.91,0:43:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Three and a half. That was it.\NI tossed the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.71,0:43:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And l'm sure you'll be very glad\Nto hear that, yes, I feel ashamed.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.30,0:43:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Skyler, this--\NI mean, this is something that--
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.80,0:43:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,-This is so unlike you. Why--?\N-Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.26,0:43:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,How would you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.93,0:43:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.08,0:44:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hank.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.65,0:44:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.15,0:45:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.37,0:45:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You asked me what\NI want you to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.93,0:45:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to handle it.
